#refbox("Reference text: Quran 7:143, quran.com (Saheeh International)", (("7:143", "And when Moses arrived at Our appointed time and his Lord spoke to him, he said, \"My Lord, show me [Yourself] that I may look at You.\" [Allāh] said, \"You will not see Me, but look at the mountain; if it should remain in place, then you will see Me.\" But when his Lord appeared to the mountain, He rendered it level, and Moses fell unconscious. And when he awoke, he said, \"Exalted are You! I have repented to You, and I am the first [among my people] of the believers.\""),))
