#passage(("Something which is very important, which I think a lot of our viewers would resonate with, is the idea of people seeking Knowledge from debate. People watch the videos online; they don't open books and read, they don't seek knowledge in that way. Their main source of seeking knowledge has become debate (even though we don't even call it debates), but they watch whatever content we do, and this has become the primary source of knowledge for people. And unfortunately they watch the wrong individuals and they end up having emotional positions.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Amazing Collab| The Muslim Lantern & Sheikh Uthman Meet For The First Time| @OneMessageFoundation”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LVdIHlFWDgc", ((92, "1:32–2:06"),), id: 3202)
