#passage(("Go check out the sources. If the person you're listening to mentions sources, something strange, funky, go check it out. If someone tosses traditional scholarship under the bus, then that's a huge red flag. If someone calls to themselves alone, that's a red flag. If someone claims that Quranic verses are about them and their channel, that's a red flag. If someone makes goofy interpretations about Quranic stories that you've never heard before, that's a red flag. Now remember, people like him are counting on your laziness in order to get away with the lies. When they reference something, you better look it up, because if you don't, they get away with it.",), "Farid Responds, “Exposing Hany Atchan (Marvelous Quran)”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y_BpFzMJgX0", ((1890, "31:30–32:11"),), id: 3204)
