#refbox("Reference text: Quran 2:256, quran.com (Saheeh International)", (("2:256", "There shall be no compulsion in [acceptance of] the religion. The right course has become distinct from the wrong. So whoever disbelieves in ṭāghūt and believes in Allāh has grasped the most trustworthy handhold with no break in it. And Allāh is Hearing and Knowing."),))
