#passage(("What advice would I give to give Da'wah to women? First, I would say women should give Da'wah to women. Number two, I would say that if in a case it's done publicly, a man will have to do it, because if a woman is doing this, she'll end up getting attacked, she'll end up getting harassed. They already do without doing this, so imagine if they're doing it. So we would say how to give her dawah: the same way you give dawah to a man, simple. You tell them about Islam, tell them there's one God worthy of worship, tell them about Prophet Muhammad, because the Message of Islam is universal; it's for both men and women. Why do you think there's a different way of giving the Message to men or women? It shouldn't be different. Same thing, same Message, same Book.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “The One Minute Podcast | Sneak∅ Interviews The Muslim Lantern | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8fgMbBAaheo", ((814, "13:34–14:12"),), id: 3273)
