something knowing that I'm wrong, and I'm doing it even though I know I'm wrong, then I'm going to continue doing it. So you could try, indirectly, here and there, but I'm telling you, don't have this idea that I have to convince someone of something. It's the wrong attitude.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “How Do You Know Which Religion Is From God? A Detailed Comprehensive Analysis | The Muslim Lantern”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9F5gS1yWIRI", ((4318, "1:11:58–1:13:25"), (4410, "1:13:30–1:14:13"), (4453, "1:14:13–1:15:07"), (4507, "1:15:07–1:15:57"), (4557, "1:15:57–1:16:48"),), id: 3277)

