it to educate yourself.", "I've read the Bible, I read the Hindu scriptures, I've read the Sikh scriptures. I've been talking about these things in my videos. Anyone who watches my videos will see I quote these scriptures because I've read them. I researched them. Now, that is what an open-minded, intelligent individual would do. You would read the scriptures. You'll actually see for yourself what they say, rather than allowing other people to dictate to you and tell you what they actually say.", "It highlights the mentality of many people. They are not even willing to take that step of actually reading what the Islamic scriptures say, rather than just being blind followers of what their environment is telling them. They want to live in this bubble. They don't want to exit their comfort zone. They live in this safe space that they believe is a safe space of herd sheep mentality, of following what people around them tell them to do, rather than actually picking up something for yourself and reading it.", "So I want to give a message to Asmongold: he seems genuine. He seems like he wants to read and learn more about Islam. And some of his audience, or a lot of his audience, even seem very interested in Islam. So I'm extending this kind of friendly invitation. If he likes, I'm available to talk about Islam, it's just a friendly discussion. If he has any questions, he is welcome to ask me. If his followers or audience even have any questions, they're also welcome to ask about Islam. I think that is the best method of educating people, educating them about the religion, and they can actually learn and understand what their religion teaches, rather than being so close minded about what it actually teaches. So I'm more than happy to have a friendly discussion with him. It doesn't have to be on camera, even. On or off camera, whatever he's comfortable with. And hopefully, maybe we will talk about Islam soon or in the future. God knows. I think it's brilliant to try and educate ourselves about these topics.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Asmongold Wants To Read The Quran?! Chunkz Will Disown His Kids If They Leave Islam?!”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y2zJLeRXXXk", ((674, "11:14–11:44"), (704, "11:44–12:27"), (781, "13:01–13:29"), (812, "13:32–13:51"), (840, "14:00–14:26"), (869, "14:29–15:41"),), id: 3278)
