#passage(("My message to our brother in humanity, JiDion, is this: I completely like how you changed your life, and I ask God to keep you firm on leaving these worldly things and leaving these worldly desires and guiding you towards the Truth, but all I want to say to you is this: maybe, you've done all of this, you've left this life of millions of views, and fame and all of that, and now, you started following an idea which is not true. Have you thought about that? Everything you've said right now is correct: the idea about people are going to die, and that we need to not focus on the worldly life and we need to focus on God. But the question is your idea of God, your description of God, what you're following right now: how do you know for a fact that this is true, coming from the Creator? Because those things that you've said, we all agree they're true, and I've given references from the Quran and Sunnah that they are true, so they're not unique to Christianity. But the difference between Islam and Christianity is the concept of God, the difference between Islam and Christianity is about the identity of Jesus. So, what if you were wrong about the identity of Jesus and you've left all of that to follow something which is not true? That is something that I want you to really investigate and think about.", "Allahﷻ says in the Quran in a very important verse, in Chapter:18 (alKahf) towards the end: قُلْ هَلْ نُنَبِّئُكُم بِٱلْأَخْسَرِينَ أَعْمَـٰلًا (Shall I inform you of those who are most wasteful of their deeds?) They've done deeds but they're wasteful of those deeds, those people who are doing things in this life and they think they're doing good. ٱلَّذِينَ ضَلَّ سَعْيُهُمْ فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا (They've been misguided in this life but they think they're doing good.) So, you think you've done all of these things, and of course, it's good to leave the worldly life and focus on the Afterlife and God, but are you focusing on the right idea of God? Are you focusing on the right understanding? Are you focusing on the TRUE revelation of God? That's a question that I would like you to think about, and I invite you for a discussion, on or off camera. It's a respectful discussion, no debate, no shouting, no screaming, no argumentation, just a respectful discussion to maybe investigate that. Have you left those things for something which is true? Or perhaps, you think you're upon the Truth when you're not 100% upon the Truth.", "I’m trying to just have a nice chat, because you seem like a genuine person, a respectful person, and this is just an extended invitation from a Muslim. Perhaps, we can actually analyse and talk about our different faiths or different religions and come to a conclusion about whether what you're following is actually True or NOT True. We both have an intellect, we all have reasoning, and I'm sure, if you're a sincere person – as you seem to be a sincere person – you will understand whether what you're following is actually True, or if the Truth is actually somewhere else. I hope Allahﷻ guides you and me to the Truth, inshaAllah (if God wills).",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Popular Youtuber Abandons Money And Fame For Christianity?! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F3uZK_khCsk", ((1267, "21:07–22:11"), (1333, "22:13–23:11"), (1407, "23:27–24:04"),), id: 3283)
