#passage(("One of the main important points I would say, when it comes to sincerity, is the idea of you studying Islam for 10 to 12 years, because you brought up the idea that how long do you guys fast? And you said is it one day? And it's impossible for someone to study Islam for 10 to 12 years and not know that Ramadan is 30 days.", "I really hope sincerely you actually look at Islam and study Islam. It's good that you looked, you came across my videos, you saw what I present, but it actually would be good to pick up a copy of the Quran and read. I think you need to do a little bit more research on these issues, when it comes to the idea of the Creeds, like I mentioned the Athanasius creed, the Nicene creed, the Constantinople Creed. What happened between Athanasius and Arius? All the Church history and what took place in Church history, so you can get a better grip of what I'm talking about. I want you to actually do your research and come to your own conclusions, and I'm happy to get any questions from you about Islam as well.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Claims He Studied Islam For 12 Years?! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gvPZJMH0co4", ((2100, "35:00–35:11"), (2133, "35:33–36:35"),), id: 3284)
