#passage(("There's nothing really that I can do except to bring evidence from the Quran and clarify to the people, because I know there are sincere people who will sit down and listen and hear the evidence and be like, okay, this makes sense. There's people who will follow what they want to follow in the end. Purpose is to give the message. It's not purpose to convince anyone. I sincerely hope that we have a new generation of young duat doing things the right way; nothing will make me happier. And I'm always worry of people coming new on the scene, because you got to watch and see what they do.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “This Trend NEEDS To Stop Now!”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mc-2HiePa94", ((1612, "26:52–27:25"),), id: 3340)
