#passage(("All those [clowns] are like, \"Wow, we need thousands of dollars in order to set up our channels, help us out.\" You don't need jack. This is my setup. Laptop: not everyone has a laptop, but most of you guys have laptops. Use any laptop. This is an i3 laptop, 10th generation, nothing fancy at all. All the programs I'm using are free: VSDC free video editor, free. I'm not really spending much on this stuff. Logitech webcam, 720p, I think costs like 40 dollars. And finally, last but not least, my lighting setup. So you don't need thousands of dollars. You probably have everything you need. Get to work.",), "Farid Responds, “No More Excuses”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VceNCESEt3k", ((1, "0:01–1:08"),), id: 3352)
