#passage(("We talked about something which is interesting, which is the idea of [blurring] people in the video. As you said in the beginning, we used to do [blurring] our videos. I remember I was doing it myself on Premier Pro; it's taking long hours. It takes long hours on Premier Pro to do. Now I have [an editor], [alhamdulillah]; at least he helps.", "My viewers have got used to that. So what happened is this: recently I uploaded a video, and the editor, he forgot to [blur], because I was reacting to something or commenting something. He forgot to [blur] a short few seconds, and I have people commenting and emailing me. This has become a habit for the people watching: okay, we know this brother, he doesn't have music, for example; this brother, he doesn't have this and that. We need to speak now to the people who are not doing this, the [duat] who are not doing this on their channels. Two things: first the [duat], and then the people, to put pressure on them to do this on the channel. We need to start this as a Sunnah. Don't say to me Westerners are doing this, people are used to it, TV; it's irrelevant.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Amazing Collab| The Muslim Lantern & Sheikh Uthman Meet For The First Time| @OneMessageFoundation”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LVdIHlFWDgc", ((2529, "42:09–42:41"), (2602, "43:22–44:05"),), id: 3353)
