#passage(("Now, the question is, why would you not accept Prophet Muhammad as a Prophet if this is the case? Why would you not become a Muslim if this is the Truth? Let's leave the past, let's leave how you grew up, let's leave the history, let's talk about today. Why are you not a Muslim right now? Why wouldn't you accept the religion of Islam? Why wouldn't you accept the Truth? The religion that Jesus was upon.", "Following Jesus would be becoming a Muslim, because just like Jesus was sent, Moses was sent, Abraham was sent, Prophet Muhammad was sent (alimran3:144). They're all Prophets coming from the same God. They taught you the same thing (ashShura42:13).", "So don't delay. We will stand before God! You can play games, we can pretend we don't see the Truth; we will stand before God. If something is True, then I'm supposed to submit to the Creator, and worship that God instantly! I don't play games: this is the Truth, OK, I'm going to accept the Truth. That's how your attitude should be: you should be a person of Truth, not a person of desires. Not what suits me, not what I like. It's what God has sent down, what is truly from the Creator, and is what I'm supposed and ought to follow.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Questions A Muslim On The Return Of Jesus Then This Happens! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EepfuZMN91I", ((1079, "17:59–18:41"), (1175, "19:35–19:43"), (1190, "19:50–20:22"),), id: 3385)
