#passage(("You're welcome to become Muslim! It's a very easy process and step, but it's a decision you make on your own. If you feel like Islam makes sense, and you want to become Muslim, you want to worship God alone, because this life is a test, and we need to obey God's Messengers, all of them, and the Prophet Muhammad is the last one, and the Message came with him, which is the Quran, that we need to obey and follow and listen to. So, if you believe in that, and you want to become a Muslim and obey God and follow the teachings of his Messenger, you're welcome! You can do it now even, if you want to. It's a very simple process. If you want to do something else, that's also completely up to you.", "There is no pressure. So do your research, and if things make sense to you, whenever you want to become Muslim, you can speak to another Muslim, or go to the mosque, whatever you do, it's fine, it's up to you. And if they don't make sense to you, then you can continue to do your research as well. These are all your decisions and choices.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Lady Questions Muslim On Evidence Of God! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Nk4EM0u0VNs", ((2111, "35:11–35:43"), (2161, "36:01–36:16"),), id: 3390)
