#passage(("Based on what I said to you, Prophet Mohammad has to be a Messenger of God. Not could be, but he is. If something has no other possibilities, by default it's certain. There's no other rational possibility other than him being a Messenger of God.", "If you have the Truth, you have to win. Allah says in the Quran22:46 فَإِنَّهَا لَا تَعۡمَى ٱلۡأَبۡصَـٰرُ وَلَـٰكِن تَعۡمَى ٱلۡقُلُوبُ ٱلَّتِی فِی ٱلصُّدُورِ Verily, it is not the eyes that become blind, rather the hearts that are in the breasts that become blind. So, they are blinded. You as someone outsider, you can see what's wrong with these people! How can you be in such embarrassment, you got no answers, you don't know anything, but you're still there, you're trying to preach. They're blinded, and that's why Allah is The One Who guides.", "That's why I'm telling you, right now you're ready, you should take the Shahada and go forward with this step. Do not delay, because your delaying might be one of the reasons your heart is closed and shut to Islam in the future. So, you are there today, it makes sense to you, the evidences are there, Allah has [brought] you here today, you got your questions answered. So, you should move on and accept Islam. Once you take it you will see how it is different, because it's a Testimony of Faith that you say; it will impact your heart inshaAllah.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Arab Christian Introduced To The Challenge Of The Quran! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n-flvFktgzU", ((1531, "25:31–26:06"), (1579, "26:19–27:02"), (1623, "27:03–27:38"),), id: 3393)
