#passage(("The only thing that is really stopping you from accepting Islam is Satan. He's trying to use the excuse of the idea of wearing the Hijab.", "If you already believe in the teachings of Islam, I would tell you to become Muslim. If someone comes to me and he says to me: I've not read the Quran, I don't know anything about Islam, I would say: OK, read the Quran, learn about what it teaches. But if I already believe in what a book teaches, then what is stopping me from actually practising it in my life? Because if you believe it's true, then you believe there will be accountability when you die. So this has to come from you, and of course you are very responsible, you can do whatever you want to do.", "Because I want good for you, like I want for my three sisters, I would say the same thing I would say to them, I would say to you. You becoming Muslim is your guarantee to reach Paradise when you die. Any day I can leave this life, anyone can leave. I cannot reach my home today, maybe. And this is how I live my life, because I know it's a temporary thing, and if you're smart you will always think long term, not short term. If you think long term, you will die one day. So long term is the Afterlife, it's not this life. So I need to prepare for that before preparing for this life, which is not that important.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “French Girls Interested In Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rl6DIJLkZu8", ((1189, "19:49–19:54"), (1237, "20:37–21:00"), (1273, "21:13–21:40"),), id: 3395)
