#passage(("I'm not going to put you on the spot. You can take your time and think about it. For me, it's not about: oh, just become a Muslim right now. If you want to, I'm more than happy. Of course, you can. However, you would accept Islam upon conviction. That's the purpose, to accept Islam upon true conviction, about understanding it, researching and making sure that everything you hear is the truth.", "However, you would only have one of two choices. Allah says in the Quran, if they do not listen to you, if they don't accept the message after the proofs have been presented, they know they're only following their desires. There's only two paths: the path of guidance from God, or the path of: I want to do this, I want to do that, I like to do this, my family is this, my this is that. But, one day I'm going to die. And if this is the truth, which we already know is the truth, we already established that, then there will be a resurrection day. I will be held accountable for everything I do. And either I'm going to have eternal punishment or eternal reward. There's no third option.", "So, I can trick and play games and not do what the creator has commanded me to do, or I can say, you know what? This must be the truth. I've already established it as the truth. So, I'm going to accept it for my own benefit. And since I'm accepting it, I'm connecting with God, I'm having a relationship with God, I shouldn't fear anything. God is on my side. You see me, I'm here. I'm very happy. I get my iced tea. I'm enjoying the truth. What's the problem? You can do the same.", "We're not saying you just become a Muslim and do some crazy thing over there. No. You become a Muslim, you're going to live your life, but you live your life as a believer. Of course, you'll have 2 billion brothers and sisters. You'll continue living your life. But the things that are not beneficial for you, [you'll] avoid. And you will give gratitude to the one who gave you everything, the one who created you, the one who gives you life, the one who allows you to exist. So, there is something you need to ponder upon.", "And try this. You know how Muslims pray? We put our forehead on the floor. Go put your forehead on the floor and ask God. Just say: God, the creator of this universe, guide me. Do you have anything to lose? No. Tonight, go. Purify yourself, maybe take a shower, purify yourself, so you can meet God in the purest state. Prostrate and say, \"Oh God.\" Try it. Genuinely, sincerely do it from your heart. You can say, \"God, if you're there, the creator of the universe, guide me to the truth.\" That's all you should do. And nobody's going to ask you to pray to any human being. Just do that.", "And then investigate the evidences that you've been given. And if they are the truth, then be a person of sincerity, a person of integrity, and accept the truth. It's a gradual process. You accept Islam, you step by step learn. You implement the truth in your life bit by bit. You avoid things which are harmful. Islam is easy and is bringing you benefit in your life. Nobody should stay away from something that brings them benefit. It's not about rushing you, about getting you to do the thing; it's about you processing information and taking that step when you're ready.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Surprises Intelligent Lady With Undeniable Evidence For Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qzJXd-FotIo", ((2431, "40:31–40:51"), (2453, "40:53–41:30"), (2493, "41:33–42:05"), (2525, "42:05–42:35"), (2556, "42:36–43:37"), (2617, "43:37–44:28"),), id: 3421)
