#passage(("I expect from you to be a person who's a seeker of truth. If what I said to you made sense and sounds truthful, and you go and you confirm it, and it is the way that I said, then you submit to your creator. That's all that I would expect from anybody who's a truth seeker. And you make your decision, because this life is a test. It's not upon me to convince anybody. It's upon me to deliver the message. Allah says in the Quran, it's only upon the messenger to give the message. It's not upon us to guide anybody to do anything.", "I'm giving you what I believe is the truth after research. What you can do is go and figure out. Research, investigate, and if it is all true, then a sincere person would submit to his God. Say, \"Okay, if this is from God, if this messenger is from God, if this revelation is from God, and I'm going to die and meet my creator, so I want to meet my creator the right way. So, I'm going to submit to that and I'm going to follow it.\" Or someone could be like, \"I don't want to.\" I'll be like, \"Okay, we'll all die one day.\" I could be crossing the street today and I die. I don't know. Nobody knows where their time comes. People always expect: oh, the average life expectancy. You don't know when you're going to die. Nobody knows. I have family members that died very young. In their 20s and their 30s, they died. People die.", "We are here to live. We're not here to stay. Prophet said you'll be in this life like a traveler. I'm a traveler. Right now, I'm leaving tomorrow. I'm not going to start a business. I'm like, \"No. I'm a traveler. I'm leaving tomorrow.\"",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Wise Christian Questions The Consistency Of The Teachings Of Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QEeureFKaFM", ((1411, "23:31–23:56"), (1439, "23:59–24:42"), (1486, "24:46–24:58"),), id: 3422)

