#passage(("Allah is showing you the right way today. Allah is opening the door for you and giving you a chance. You were worried about sinning, you got answers. You're worried about this, you got answers. You want to go to the mosque, go as a Muslim. Go as a brother in Islam and pray with the brothers. Not just watch them, but act! Pray with them. Be a part of the community in reality, not just watch from further away. When you go inside the building, you can look at the furniture. If you're outside, how are you going to look at the furniture? Come inside the building first and then look at this beautiful furniture, beautiful ceiling. So enter Islam first, and then look at things around you.", "I think you're ready. Do you know why I think you're ready? Because you've been waiting for three years. Three years you've been ready. You've been reading the Quran. You know sins are forgiven if you become Muslim. You know what's going to happen to you. You know what Allah is, you know what Prophet Muhammad is. What are you waiting for? You're there.", "Allah says you don't know if tomorrow you're going to end up in your grave or not (Luqman31:34). Wallahi, you're walking by right now and you die, the thing you would wish for the most is that you took that step. Why? Because it's too late. No doors are open anymore.", "If you know you will stop, why you don't stop today? If you can't stop right now, do you think a miracle will happen when you become Muslim, and then everything will change? You're not thinking clearly. You're letting the Shaytan play with your mind. If you die on Islam, you're guaranteed to go to Paradise. You're saying \"open a business, do this\". Do you think you're guaranteed that you're going to live to do that? Wallahi, I do not know if I'm here tomorrow or not. Next two hours, I do not know if I'm here or not. What makes you guaranteed you're going to get married, you're going to start a business? Who told you that? Allah says: The Jews and the Christians, they say we'll be only punished for a period of time in the fire. Allah says: Did Allah tell you that? Did Allah give you that promise? (alBaqarah2:80) Did Allah promise you He will wait until you get that business, you get married? So how do you know? Me and you, we do not know the day we'll leave this life.", "Even if you are a Muslim and you will have issues with your girlfriend that you talked about, you're still a Muslim. And when you leave that thing and repent, Allah will forgive you. He will replace your bad deeds into good deeds.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Emotional Shahada! Brother Accepts Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hvQ9biPlbos", ((451, "7:31–8:15"), (501, "8:21–8:43"), (530, "8:50–9:02"), (572, "9:32–10:37"), (644, "10:44–10:52"),), id: 3423)
