#passage(("Is it about the truth or is it about what we spend time doing? I could be spending many years doing something wrong. But it's about the truth. It's about what actually is from God. It's about what God actually wants from us. It's about how to truly have a true connection with God, true relationship with God the way he commanded us to, not the way we invent ourselves. So it's about truth.", "You'll deny everything you're upon? That's not true, because there's so many similarities. What you will deny is that which is not from God: things which are not rational, things that are not from God. Jesus told you to follow the law. Jesus prayed. Jesus fasted. You don't have Christians fasting, but Jesus fasted. Jesus prayed. He was from the Middle East. He's a Palestinian. He would have dressed like the people at the time. His mother: go to any picture in any church, covering her head like Muslim woman. He was circumcised. So it's not about that you are going to deny everything. You got to deny the lies that people have taught you that are not from Jesus.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Lady Grills Muslim With Questions Then A Surprise Happens! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JOpckbnPmsM", ((2044, "34:04–34:26"), (2071, "34:31–35:26"),), id: 3436)
