#passage(("A lot of people turn to Christianity because they reach a state of desperation. They despair from everything, and if you have no God in your life, you have no life, you're dead! So they try to seek anything that has any hint of spirituality, has any remnants of spirituality, and because of their surroundings, they turn to Christianity, because that's what's around them. But if they actually do what you did, do some research, they will end up realising that this is not it. This is not the Truth, and when they do a bit more research, they will realise Islam is the Truth in the end.", "If you believe in your heart that this is the Truth, you believe in your heart that there's only one Creator worthy of worship, Allah. He's not a human being, He's not a man, He doesn't die on the cross, doesn't have a father, a son, a grandmother. He's not like that. And that He sent Prophets and Messengers. He sent Jesus, Moses, Noah, Abraham, all of those people to guide people to Him, not to guide people to \"them,\" but to guide people to the Creator, not to the Creation. So, if you believe in that, then you essentially have everything you need to be a Muslim.", "Now, the idea about learning that you talk about: you think that when you will become Muslim, you'll stop learning? No! When you become Muslim, you're going to continue to learn even more. I'm learning every day. So if you're thinking that you want to learn more, this is a trick that Shaytan (Satan) uses with the people to stop them from accepting the Truth, because he wants to delay you and make you die without accepting the Truth. Because if you die without accepting the Truth, then he won, because you're not going to go to Paradise. You're going to be punished for not accepting the Truth. So, his goal is to delay the people as much as possible. But if you've got the foundation, if you already believe in the foundation of Islam, you believe in your heart without a shadow of a doubt that this is the Truth from God, then it does not matter learning a little bit more, because that will happen anyways when you become Muslim. 10 years after you're a Muslim, you come back, you see yourself learning more and more.", "There are people who spent over 20 years abroad; they travelled to some Muslim countries to learn, and they're still learning, because there is no one who doesn't learn. The biggest scholar on Earth today is still learning, because Islam is the vast sea. The scholars say that the journey of knowledge starts from the Cradle to the Grave. It ends with you dying. It ends with the grave, so it's a gradual process. Every day, I'm learning new information, I'm learning new things about Islam. So, if it's about the learning, the learning is there.", "The only thing where I would tell you not to accept Islam is if you're not sure that this is the Truth. If you don't believe that Allah is God and Prophet Muhammad is a Prophet, then I will tell you, \"Don't do it.\" But if you believe, and all of this makes sense to you, then my advice is to actually take the step and then learn. You're watching videos, you'll be learning. You'll be reading articles, you'll be learning. I'll connect you with people, with our mentoring teams; they will be mentoring you, teaching you along the way, taking you step by step, teaching you the basics of Islam, how to pray, everything that you need, and while you're doing that, you'll be learning a bit more and more and more. This is the journey you'll take. It's a gradual journey, step by step, learning day by day.", "In the end, no one can force anything on you. It's your choice to accept Islam because it makes sense to you. No one has forced you to accept Islam. No one has told you you have to believe this is the Truth. You yourself found it through being sincere and through God guiding you towards the Truth. The more you learn about Islam, the more you'll be sure it's from God. The more you learn about Christianity, the more you will find problems and then be worried. Islam is the complete opposite, because it's the Truth. The more you learn about it, the more you'll be sure that this has to be it, this has to be the Truth from the Creator.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Asks God For A Sign Then This Happens! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HhJvhr8ihyY", ((546, "9:06–9:38"), (588, "9:48–10:08"), (612, "10:12–10:57"), (662, "11:02–11:36"), (696, "11:36–12:17"), (741, "12:21–12:57"),), id: 3454)
