#passage(("Nobody's perfect. That's another thing that Satan uses with the people. A bad Muslim is better than someone who's not a Muslim at all. Still a Muslim. Still believes in God. So if someone disobeys God completely, doesn't believe in a creator, doesn't worship God, denies God, and someone obeys God, but still does some bad things, he still believes in God. He still obeys God. He still recognises God. So a religious believer is better than someone who doesn't believe at all, doesn't believe in God, doesn't worship God. It's not the same. Even if someone commits bad things, the other person will always commit bad things as well. But on top of the bad things they will commit, they will also not believe in God! Which is the biggest sin you could do. They will reject God completely.", "Allah tells us in the Quran (alBaqara2:208) that Satan has footsteps. He has a method that he applies with people. So the things that he tells you, he tells everyone else also before they become Muslim, so he can deter them from taking that step. What matters is you're there, you believe what you need to believe. And the guiding on the initial steps, we'll do that. I'll connect you with people who will mentor you, take care of you step by step, knowing what you need to do on your journey.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Baha'i Lady Questions Muslim On The Last Prophet! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5_h1_yrAXLg", ((1484, "24:44–25:27"), (1556, "25:56–26:23"),), id: 3461)
