#passage(("Allah doesn't look at your history. What matters is from this moment on, in the future, what you're going to do. As long as, once you accept Islam, you try to do your best, you try to learn how to pray, practice as much as you can, Allah forgives all your previous [sins].",), "The Muslim Lantern, “English Lads Shock Muslim With Their Knowledge Of Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=scOrjqCuSm0", ((441, "7:21–7:35"),), id: 3475)
