#passage(("The Message of Islam is simple. It's beautiful. It's simple. Prophet Muhammad invited everyone to the same thing. People want to hate on Muslims. You go to the church, they tell you this person is not going to save you. You will go to the Mosque and you'll see! Nobody talks about Christianity, because the mosque is a place to worship God. It's not a place to talk about other Faiths, and other religions.", "This is the purpose of life: it's to connect with God. And what you have is something we call the فطرة (Fitra). Fitra is that innate disposition to recognise God. God has put it in everyone. This innate disposition recognises The Truth. People can day and night tell you it's OK to kill innocent kids. It's not going to fit with you! Because your Fitra, what God put inside you, tells you: no! This is wrong! This doesn't make sense. And if the people listen to the Fitra, listen to your innate disposition, the pure position given to them by God, they'll all be guided to The Truth, because Allah is guiding everyone to The Truth. Allah, His doors are open for everyone to become a Muslim (alBaqara2:21).",), "The Muslim Lantern, “This Christian Came To Convert Muslim But He Didn't Expect This! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MGZ5L15SzXk", ((1346, "22:26–22:44"), (1394, "23:14–23:49"),), id: 3476)
