#passage(("Allah wants to remove your burden (anNissa4:28). Do you know sins have a burden? The burden on your back and the burden in your heart you feel is lifted. The Shaytan is putting sins on your heart, sins on your back. When you repent, when you accept Islam, Allah forgives these sins; you feel like your back is light. When you accept Islam, your faith increases, you become stronger. It's easy for you to leave this stuff.", "You did it; I didn't do anything. Allah wanted you to accept Islam. Allah brought you here today, Allah guided your heart to Islam. Allah saw good in you. He saw that you want to accept. You know other people? \"Women? I'm never going to leave women, I'm never going to leave clubbing, I'm never going to accept Islam.\" People are like this. You didn't say that. Allah saw in your heart that you have a pure heart. You're trying to learn; you're trying to become a muslim. You've been struggling for three years. Allah says that: If you struggle for Me, He will guide you to His way (arRum29:69).",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Emotional Shahada! Brother Accepts Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hvQ9biPlbos", ((1242, "20:42–21:11"), (1272, "21:12–21:41"),), id: 3477)
