#passage(("Aren't you lying to yourself, if you reject God because of your family? You shouldn't lie to your family, 100%. But isn't it a bigger lie that I live in disbelief of God, knowing that it is The Truth, and I live in denial, in a lie, because I don't want my family to perceive me in a specific way? Always understand, it's a decision you're making for God. It's not for me. It's not for your family. It's not for anyone. You're doing it for the Creator, which is why you have nothing to fear.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Baha'i Lady Questions Muslim On The Last Prophet! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5_h1_yrAXLg", ((1662, "27:42–28:20"),), id: 3487)
// U ML038:884-931 | The Muslim Lantern | 2
#passage(("If it makes sense to you, then I think you should accept Islam. I don't think you should delay it. Protect yourself first, because if you die today, I cannot say, \"Oh, I was waiting so I can speak to my family.\" Allah will tell: \"You knew this is the truth. You lived not praying to God, not giving thanks to God, not submitting to God.\"", "You got to start with yourself. If you're sick and then you see someone who's sick and you're like, \"Go buy a medicine.\" \"You're sick, too. Why you not buying medicine yourself? First, you go buy a medicine, heal, and then come and try and heal me.\" If we're both sick and I'm telling, \"Oh, I want to heal this person,\" well, first you got to fix yourself, and then work from there.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Lady Grills Muslims On Equality Between Genders In Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jmKBzsd6zsw", ((2784, "46:24–47:53"), (2907, "48:27–48:52"),), id: 3488)
