#passage(("This statement of faith: he's testifying there's nothing worthy of worship except Allah, absolute [adoration] given to the creator, nothing else, worshipping Allahﷻ, not associating any partners with Him. And dying upon that statement is the key to entering paradise.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Scandinavian Man Surprises Muslim With A Difficult Question! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mf3NbKmeOt8", ((916, "15:16–15:34"),), id: 3511)
