// U ML271:293-349 | The Muslim Lantern | 3
#passage(("Do you know what you would lose if you didn't become Muslim? First, your sanity, and the second thing your Afterlife. No amount of medication you're going to take is going to cure what you've seen. Nothing is going to cure it! Because people, they do these actions. I don't know how some people in the Army do these things! They do these actions and they think there's no consequences! They take drugs so they can not feel anything when they're doing these things.", "You're a lot better than if someone wants to become Muslim in Tel Aviv or something like that. If he wants to become Muslim there, he's got a lot of things to worry about. You, on the other hand, you are in a Country where you shouldn't have a problem by doing that, by accepting Islam. No one can have a better friend, or a better Protector than Allahﷻ.", "You don't have to do the Shahada in a Mosque. You can do it right now. You don't need to go to anyone! You go to the Creator who sees you testifying, because you're testifying for God. You believe in Allah, He's The One worthy of worship. You believe Prophet Muhammadﷺ is His Messenger. You believe the Quran is from God, you believe in the Prophets of God, you believe you need to do good in your life. You want to seek repentance, you need to seek forgiveness from Allahﷻ. That's what matters!",), "The Muslim Lantern, “IDF Soldier Confronted A Muslim Live Then THIS HAPPENED! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-qnYJXIxSpc", ((965, "16:05–16:47"), (1028, "17:08–17:27"), (1064, "17:44–19:12"),), id: 3515)
