// U ML297:636-683 | The Muslim Lantern | 4
#passage(("This is what I always say to the people here before they accept Islam: that you will see when you do it, it was not as much of a big deal as Satan was making you think before you made it. It's a Testimony of Faith; submitting to The Creator, and you're doing it for God, so there's nothing to fear. There's nothing to worry about. It’s as if you're saying now, you're testifying to God that you worship him, that you want to believe in him, that you want to practise Islam in your life.", "Say: I testify that there's nothing worthy of worship except Allah, and that Prophet Muhammad is the Messenger and servant of Allah and that Jesus is the Messenger and Servant of Allah.", "It is accepting God, so it's the best thing that can happen to you in your life. So if it's a huge thing, it's a huge thing from a good perspective, that this is a good transition that you're going to make in your life, by testifying that God is the only one worthy of worship.", "And now, if you continue to worship Allahﷻ in a way that befits His Majesty, Allahﷻ will forgive you, and He will increase you. The Prophetﷺ said: إِنَّ الدِّينَ يُسْرٌ (Verily, the religion is easy). Islam is easy. It's only Satan trying to make it a big deal, people around you trying to make it a big deal. Islam is very easy, becoming a Muslim is very easy, practising Islam -you will see- it's easy. You take it step-by-step. No one is going to push you, nothing is. It's a choice that you make because you want to.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Sister Cries After Realising Islam Is The Truth! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PtJpInP1jl8", ((1872, "31:12–31:33"), (1904, "31:44–31:57"), (1964, "32:44–32:54"), (1974, "32:54–33:33"),), id: 3518)
// U ML311:481-541 | The Muslim Lantern | 4
#passage(("It's giving the rights of Allah to Allah. It's saying outwardly to everyone that there is nothing that is worthy of my Worship except Allah. There is no real Creator, there's no real God, nothing else is worthy of your devotion and worship except Allah, and that Prophet Muhammadﷺ is a Messenger of God, is a Servant of God that was sent by him, and this is the Message that came from him, and that I accepted and I believe it. What is more special than that? It is you applying that in your life.", "I know sometimes it's also because you come from a Christian background, and a lot of people think about the baptism and being in the church and all of these different things. They think it has to be this. No! This is how it was at the time of the Prophetﷺ: a person came and he said to the Prophetﷺ أَشْهَدُ أَنّ لَّا إِلَٰهَ إِلَّإ الله وأَشْهَدُ أنك رسول الله, I testify that you are the Prophet of God, and that's it! And they enter into the fold of Islam, because most and foremost is about your belief, and now you're verbalising that which you believe, which makes it the most special.", "Allahﷻ brought you for a reason today. You came for a reason, and you said what you said for a reason, because Allahﷻ wants you to do it today. He wanted to give you that chance, because we gamble with things, we shouldn't be gambling. Especially in this day and age, you have statistics if you look in the UK: one of two people dying from cancer. They just wake up and the next day they're dead, or they are in the bed, they're dead. You don't even know if you're gonna wake up tomorrow or not. We have certain disease we don't know; you're walking by, a car hits you. We are in a dangerous country, we have the highest rates of stabbing; London has One of the highest rates in the world. So we shouldn't be gambling with these type of things. If we know it's the Truth, we move ahead and we take that step.", "You want to go again to the Mosque, go to the Mosque! No one is stopping you, but at least now you know you've done what you need to do -the Shahada-. Anything happens to you, you already testified to Allahﷻ is worthy of worship and you're following Allahﷻ.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Sincere Man Realises The Contradictions In Christianity! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CR6_RG9qdVM", ((1700, "28:20–29:50"), (1795, "29:55–30:13"), (1819, "30:19–30:51"), (1865, "31:05–31:12"),), id: 3519)
