#passage(("The first pillar is الشهادة Shahada, which is the testimony of faith, of how to enter Islam. So you testify nothing is worthy of your worship, complete love, complete gratitude, obedience other than The Creator. And you testify that Prophet Muhammad is His Messenger, which means that you testify that you would follow him, because he is the Messenger of God like the other Messengers, and they are the ones sent by the King, so we follow the King.", "And then you have the prayer, 5 times a day, and you will learn the details step by step. Then you have what we call زَّكاةُ Zakat, which is an obligatory charity, which is 2.5% of your wealth that you give, if you are wealthy enough. Then رمضان Ramadan, that we fast, and you will see the benefits of it. I don't think food tastes like food outside رمضان. In رمضان actually it tastes like food, and you will get what I am saying when you fast. And then you have Pilgrimage, which is حَجْ: you travel to Makkah and then you do your pilgrimage, which is once in a lifetime, if you have the financial capacity to do that.", "Then we have 6 articles of faith. You believe in Allah. Allah is Self-Sufficient, does not have children, does not begotten nor is born, independent and nothing is like [unto] him. And you believe in the Messengers of God, believe in the previous Revelations that God sent to the Messengers, that some of them have been changed, corrupted. You believe in the angels of God, and you believe in the Last Day, the Day of Judgement, and you believe in destiny: that Allah destined that we will talk in this time, because we had the plan maybe to talk tomorrow, but all of the sudden we are talking today. But Allah destined that you will become Muslim today, that you will get your questions answered today, that this will happen in this way.", "So this is what we believe, its called قَدَر, the Predestination of Allah, that Allah predestined that things will happen this way. Allah put the situation in front of you; everything is happening with Allah's Will. And he knows the things that will happen, He has written down the things that will happen. So these are the main articles of faith that we believe in as Muslims, and the 5 pillars that we focus on.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “If You Answer My QUESTIONS I will Accept Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C2LVHjA4HbM", ((1192, "19:52–20:12"), (1219, "20:19–20:52"), (1255, "20:55–21:22"), (1287, "21:27–21:40"),), id: 3539)
