#passage(("What happened in your past, happened in your past! Right now, you're a Muslim from our point of view. Muslims open their doors for everyone, and I want a lot of people to understand this: we don't look at someone's past before they accept Islam. Some of the Companions of the Prophetﷺ were trying to kill him before they accepted Islam. They were attempting to take his life, which is greater than anything you would do, to kill the Messenger of God. And when they accepted Islam, he told his Companions the same thing I'm going to tell you now: It's that Allahﷻ forgives the sins of the past and the mistakes that you did.", "But you have to change your life. You need to fix things mentally in your mind. You were talking about prayers; that's a good thing to look for, which is important: you need to change your life into the right direction through doing that. This is a psychological issue that you will need to deal with yourself. You need to confront yourself with this issue, you need to understand that what you did was wrong, you need to seek forgiveness, and The Only One Who can change your heart and cure your heart is ALLAH.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “IDF Soldier Confronted A Muslim Live Then THIS HAPPENED! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-qnYJXIxSpc", ((1159, "19:19–20:41"), (1241, "20:41–21:29"),), id: 3547)
