#passage(("Make dua for us, because you have a white slate now. I want you to remember one thing, if you remember anything from today: remember that you did this for Allah. And because you did it for Allah, you never did a wrong choice. Your choice was the right choice, because you did it for God. You didn't do it for me, you didn't do it for anyone. You did it for Allah.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Emotional Shahada! Brother Accepts Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hvQ9biPlbos", ((1405, "23:25–24:21"),), id: 3566)

