t in this case. If I wanted to clout chase, I'm not going to choose someone who has less number than me.", "And also he says: \"[Sneako], I'm going to talk to you. You're a Muslim, I'm a Muslim.\" No, he doesn't want to have a discussion with the Muslim that he knows is going to call him out on what he's saying. I don't even need to discuss with him anymore. There's no point of doing that, because [Sneako] did a really really good job, delivering the message that I would have delivered in this case, and brilliantly respond to the points that he was making.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Myron Gets Demolished In Sneako Debate After Ducking 1 on 1 Discussion! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2wy4D0RloNM", ((0, "0:00–1:31"), (95, "1:35–2:41"), (275, "4:35–5:25"), (332, "5:32–6:19"), (384, "6:24–8:46"), (565, "9:25–10:56"), (668, "11:08–12:54"), (779, "12:59–14:19"),), id: 3667)
