#passage(("Apostate Prophet mentions the four Muslims: that's the Thought Adventure podcasters. In that video, [Ridvan] just dodges everything and just says, \"Hey, that's irrelevant to me. I don't feel like I have to answer these questions because it's irrelevant.\" And I wonder why [Ridvan] doesn't upload that full video on his channel, unedited, not an 18minute version where you have to include commentary. Upload the video unedited, in the same way that they did. So you failed in explaining everything, but you still won the debate, and you've destroyed all the Muslim apologists in the scene. Now you declaring victory on the Guys from the Thought Adventure podcast when you have avoided uploading the full video on your channel, and you declaring victory when you've unlisted that video, says something else. You're saying something and you're doing something else. And what boggles my mind is how your fan base eats this up. It's as if we're dealing with North Koreans eating up North Korean propaganda.", "The challenge to you, three things. One, I doubt you're going to do this, because it's actually some work. It's actually some research. Maybe answers you're not going to find online, because that's all you're good for: Googling up articles against Islam. Respond to my videos. I've made 50. Number two is easy: upload the Thought Adventure podcast fully, unedited, without commentary. They don't need the commentary. They're not that thick. And number three, click that unlisted button and turn it to public debate. It's going to take you 10 seconds.",), "Farid Responds, “Challenge to Apostate Prophet”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZOYEwx9U0lM", ((215, "3:35–6:19"), (382, "6:22–7:20"),), id: 3718)
