#passage(("It seems like Christian Prince was quite annoyed by my book review yesterday, so he decided to respond to it. In brief, he admits to making errors while keeping up his arrogant tone. He attempts to deflect the points that I make by laughing them off while switching the subject. However, there is one response that he made that I feel compelled to respond to.", "Before sharing CP's response, I want to make one thing very clear. This is a challenge to CP and his teacher Imam Mura. I challenge them both to prove that this is a quote from [Ibn Hajar's] [Fath al-Bari]. The reference that CP provides is false, and nothing that he will say can change that.", "CP means that underneath this paragraph there is another paragraph with the correct source. That's not how you provide a reference. Remember, I said very clearly that no matter what CP says or does, he will not be able to provide this quote from [Fath al-Bari]. This guy is calling me a donkey because he doesn't know how to reference properly.", "There is a big problem with this piece of garbage that he calls a book, this same piece of garbage that should have been proofread by a fifth grader before being published. The problem is that the very first argument he makes, the very first paragraph that he provides, is a misattribution.",), "Farid Responds, “This video will end Christian Prince's credibility forever.”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=92vgjk6O5kA", ((2, "0:02–0:30"), (59, "0:59–1:30"), (116, "1:56–2:43"), (206, "3:26–3:46"),), id: 3731)
