#passage(("I have made a hundred accusations against you. You've attempted to respond to two, and I appreciate it, and to be honest [it] was the biggest mistake you've made. You should have ignored those two. Attempting to respond to them shows that you have the ability to attempt to respond to the other 98, so please go ahead and attempt to do that.", "So I'm a coward because I'm making videos behind your back? How is that rational? If you made three videos behind my back about me, and it wasn't in a live debate, does that mean you're a coward? Be consistent, CP. We're actually already done, but champ doesn't need to run around looking for a challenger. I don't need to go through 98 examples with you just to get your opinion. What's the score? It's a hundred to zero. He doesn't want to go through all 100, and that's why he's saying \"challenge me, challenge me and show me that I am lying\". You need to be begging me for a debate. What do you mean, you're going to make me famous? People are leaving you. These are a bunch of non-Muslims; there are some Christians here that are actually accusing CP [of lying]. They've already seen my videos, and they've accepted that CP is a liar.", "Now in regards to the debate: I definitely accept, but here's the thing: it has to be a public debate, because in a public debate you're not able to mute me, you're not able to hang up on me. We'll have a moderator; it will be a [timed] debate; everyone will be speaking in its own time, and the topic is going to be the topic that you chose: a hundred lies by Christian Prince, where we'll be going through all of those topics together. And guess what: I'm going to be flying over to where you live. I'm going to be doing this in your hometown. I'm going to be giving you the opportunity to be humiliated in front of your own community. Now I respect that you don't want to show your face, and that's perfectly fine. What you can do is you can come to the debate wearing a luchador mask, and what I will do for you is: I don't want you to feel foolish by yourself, so I'll wear one too. I'm going to get my own flight ticket and I'm going to fly all the way to the States just to have this debate, just to humiliate you in public.",), "Farid Responds, “Christian Prince challenged me to a Debate!!”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tFXltyy-37A", ((116, "1:56–2:21"), (190, "3:10–4:24"), (270, "4:30–5:38"),), id: 3746)
