#passage(("Where are these CP fanboys? I got a question for you guys. Now this isn't a question about Christianity. I'm just simply curious: after 107 accusations, do you believe that at least in some of my accusations I was correct and that Christian Prince is a liar? I'm not asking if he makes mistakes. I'm asking if he has lied. I just want a truthful response. This doesn't mean that Christianity is false, doesn't mean that Islam is true. After 107 accusations, he dodged most of it. He's only attempted to respond to six.", "Melor said yes. Thank you, Melor, for having the bravery, because I can tell that you're a big fan of Christian Prince. And I want you to think about it. I know that you hate Islam, and I'm sure that anyone that listens to Christian Prince for long enough will hate Islam. And if I did not have the knowledge that I have, then I surely would hate Islam as well. I would advise you to take even your anti-Islamic knowledge from somewhere else. There are a lot of people that hate Islam out there that are a lot more fair than Christian Prince.",), "Farid Responds, “I ask Christian Prince Fans: Is CP a liar?!”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vemWP8zAWU8", ((10, "0:10–2:34"), (166, "2:46–6:29"),), id: 3749)
